  suite_cli_target_name.adam - -t names a target by its triple only
  (PLAN-LINUX64 LX0a, his word 2026-11-21): a short name such as win64,
  before the command, is CL0009 listing every triple the registry holds,
  exit 2, nothing built
*******************************************************************************/

